N5008 [meta.trans.other] COMMON-REF: common_reference_t<int&, int&&> is
const int& (COMMON-REF(A&&, B&) = D = COMMON-REF(const A&, B&) when A&& is
convertible to D), common_reference_t<int&&, const int&> likewise, and
common_reference_with<int&, int&&> holds -- the conjunct of
indirectly_readable that blocked every user-defined iterator.  Exercises the
libstdc++ machinery end to end: __match_cv_qualifiers' private member
typedef used as a nested-name-specifier, __common_ref_impl's constrained
rvalue partial specializations (_Require<is_convertible<...>>), and an
inherited `value' looked up right after the class is completed.
